Windows installers published from this repository are not Authenticode-signed.
There is no paid code-signing certificate. SmartScreen or an "unknown publisher"
warning on first run is expected. Integrity of in-app updates is provided by an
Ed25519-signed release manifest and a SHA-512 digest of Testrix.exe, not
by a Windows Authenticode certificate.

Third-party packages remain under their own licenses in node_modules and in the
corresponding upstream repositories.
